      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "CHASING KISSES (7) had been in great form but was out of the placings last run, finishing fifth (17.76) in a Grade 5 at Taree Super Track. Normally fast to begin but shuffled back last time. Form from her last run is proving strong. Has ability and looks hard to stop. LAKOTA COURTNEY (3) has some solid form under her belt and proved too classy last time to win by 0.8 lengths at The Gardens in a handy 23.26 beating Cranky Cruiser. Leading chance again. GRAND ARTIST (1) looks close to another win after finishing third last time (23.08) at Richmond. Has performed well from this box. Best form too dangerous to ignore. Have to include. PROUD CHOICE (8) can fill a top-three spot.",
